-- ============================================================================
-- Arcadia Editions Modulith: scenario test data for place-order-flow
-- Regenerate with the zenwave-test-scenarios skill (DDL: target/ddl/schema.sql, exported 2026-11-17, models 0.10.0).
-- Values are identical in src/test/resources/data/jpa/<Entity>/<n>.json (n = row order, id = 1 + (n-1)*50).
-- Fixed test "now": 2026-10-01T12:00:00Z. Tests must read it through a fixed java.time.Clock
--   (config/ClockConfiguration.kt; the in-memory service tests pass a fixed Clock).
--
-- SCENARIO MATRIX: chain | business ids | state per aggregate | point of the flow | used by
-- C-01 | ORD-001, CUST-001 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1, Payment AUTHORIZATION_REQUESTED (attempt 1) | OrderCreated handled, authorization pending, inside the window | authorizePayment redelivery (payment exists); voidPayment no-op (AUTHORIZATION_REQUESTED); expireReservation before deadline; getPaymentStatus STARTED; getOrder CREATED
-- C-02 | ORD-002, CUST-002 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x2, Payment AUTHORIZED (attempt 1) | PaymentAuthorized emitted, confirmOrder pending; 2 lines | confirmOrder from CREATED; confirmStockReservation from RESERVED (several reservations per order)
-- C-03 | ORD-003, CUST-003 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment AUTHORIZED (attempt 1) | OrderConfirmed emitted, scheduleFulfillment pending | scheduleFulfillment; confirmOrder/confirmStockReservation redelivery (already CONFIRMED); getOrder CONFIRMED
-- C-04 | ORD-004, CUST-004 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment AUTHORIZED (attempt 1), Fulfillment SCHEDULED | FulfillmentScheduled emitted, capturePayment pending | capturePayment from AUTHORIZED; scheduleFulfillment redelivery; markReadyToShip from SCHEDULED
-- C-05 | ORD-005, CUST-005 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment CAPTURED (attempt 1), Fulfillment SCHEDULED | PaymentCaptured emitted, sendOrderConfirmation and recordPaymentCaptured pending | sendOrderConfirmation; recordPaymentCaptured from SCHEDULED (paymentCapturedAt null); capturePayment redelivery (already CAPTURED)
-- C-06 | ORD-006, CUST-006 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment CAPTURED (attempt 1), Fulfillment READY_TO_SHIP (paymentCapturedAt 10:03:05), Notification ORDER_CONFIRMATION SENT | end completed (OrderConfirmationSent); fulfillment later marked ready to ship | flow outcome completed; sendOrderConfirmation / recordPaymentCaptured redelivery; fulfillment READY_TO_SHIP read side
-- C-07 | ORD-007, CUST-007 | Notification STOCK_UNAVAILABLE SENT | end stockGone (StockUnavailableNotificationSent); no order, reservation or payment (off-chain notification) | flow outcome stockGone; reserveStock UNAVAILABLE (SKU-003 position, available 0); sendStockUnavailableNotification redelivery
-- C-08 | ORD-008, CUST-008 | Order CANCELLED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment DECLINED (attempt 1), Notification ORDER_CANCELLED SENT | end orderCancelled, cause payment declined | flow outcome orderCancelled/declined; getOrder CANCELLED; cancelOrder/releaseStock redelivery
-- C-09 | ORD-009, CUST-009 | Order CANCELLED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment RETRY_EXHAUSTED (attempt 3), Notification ORDER_CANCELLED SENT | end orderCancelled, cause retries exhausted | flow outcome orderCancelled/retry-exhausted
-- C-10 | ORD-010, CUST-010 | Order CANCELLED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment VOIDED (attempt 1), Fulfillment FAILED, Notification ORDER_CANCELLED SENT | end orderCancelled, cause fulfillment failed and authorization voided | flow outcome orderCancelled/voided; voidPayment redelivery (already VOIDED)
-- C-11 | ORD-011, CUST-011 | Order CANCELLED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment AUTHORIZATION_REQUESTED (attempt 1), Notification ORDER_CANCELLED SENT | end orderCancelled, cause reservation expired (timer saw NO_PAYMENT; the Payment came later, A-09) | flow outcome orderCancelled/expired; expireReservation redelivery (already RELEASED)
-- C-12 | ORD-012, CUST-012 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1, Payment FAILED (attempt 1) | PaymentFailed emitted (attempt 1 of 3), retryPayment pending | retryPayment retried (below limit, attemptCount 1); reauthorizePayment from FAILED (attempt 1 -> 2); voidPayment no-op (FAILED)
-- C-13 | ORD-013, CUST-013 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1, Payment FAILED (attempt 3) | PaymentFailed emitted at the retry limit, retryPayment pending | retryPayment retry-exhausted (attemptCount = N = 3)
-- C-14 | ORD-014, CUST-014 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1, Payment FAILED (attempt 2) | reservation past its deadline, payment started: ReservationExpired due | expireReservation past deadline, getPaymentStatus STARTED: no release (payment owns the end); reauthorizePayment from FAILED (attempt 2 -> 3)
-- C-15 | ORD-015, CUST-015 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1, Payment DECLINED (attempt 1) | PaymentDeclined emitted, releaseStock pending | releaseStock PAYMENT_DECLINED from RESERVED
-- C-16 | ORD-016, CUST-016 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment AUTHORIZED (attempt 1), Fulfillment FAILED | FulfillmentFailed emitted, voidPayment pending | voidPayment from AUTHORIZED (FulfillmentFailed listener)
-- C-17 | ORD-017, CUST-017 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment CAPTURE_FAILED (attempt 1), Fulfillment SCHEDULED | PaymentCaptureFailed emitted, voidPayment pending | voidPayment from CAPTURE_FAILED (PaymentCaptureFailed listener)
-- C-18 | ORD-018, CUST-018 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment VOIDED (attempt 1), Fulfillment FAILED | PaymentVoided emitted, releaseStock pending | releaseStock PAYMENT_VOIDED from CONFIRMED
-- C-19 | ORD-019, CUST-019 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment DECLINED (attempt 1) | StockReleased emitted (declined), cancelOrder pending | cancelOrder from CREATED
-- C-20 | ORD-020, CUST-020 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment VOIDED (attempt 1), Fulfillment FAILED | StockReleased emitted (voided), cancelOrder pending | cancelOrder from CONFIRMED
-- C-21 | ORD-021, CUST-021 | Order CANCELLED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment DECLINED (attempt 1) | OrderCancelled emitted, sendOrderCancelledNotification pending | sendOrderCancelledNotification; cancelFulfillment with no Fulfillment (no-op)
-- C-22 | ORD-022, CUST-022 | Order CANCELLED (RESERVATION_EXPIRED), StockReservation RELEASED x1 (RESERVATION_EXPIRED), Payment AUTHORIZED (attempt 1, late) | PaymentAuthorized after expiry and cancellation, confirmOrder pending | confirmOrder on CANCELLED -> OrderConfirmationRejected ORDER_CANCELLED; voidPayment from AUTHORIZED (OrderConfirmationRejected listener)
-- C-23 | ORD-023, CUST-023 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RELEASED x1 (RESERVATION_EXPIRED), Payment AUTHORIZED (attempt 1, late) | timer released the stock, cancelOrder not handled yet, PaymentAuthorized | confirmOrder -> confirmStockReservation NOT_HELD -> OrderConfirmationRejected STOCK_NOT_HELD
-- C-24 | ORD-024, CUST-024 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1 (SKU-006), Payment CAPTURED, Fulfillment SCHEDULED (paymentCapturedAt set), Notification ORDER_CONFIRMATION SENT | PaymentCaptured recorded, markReadyToShip pending | markReadyToShip from SCHEDULED after capture; recordPaymentCaptured redelivery
-- C-25 | ORD-025, CUST-025 | Order CANCELLED (PAYMENT_VOIDED), StockReservation RELEASED x1 (PAYMENT_VOIDED), Payment VOIDED (capture_window_closed), Fulfillment SCHEDULED | capture failed, voided, OrderCancelled emitted, cancelFulfillment pending | cancelFulfillment from SCHEDULED
-- C-26 | ORD-026, CUST-026 | Order CANCELLED (PAYMENT_VOIDED), StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment VOIDED (capture_window_closed), Fulfillment CANCELLED, Notification ORDER_CANCELLED SENT | end orderCancelled, cause capture failed and voided | flow outcome orderCancelled/capture-failed; cancelFulfillment redelivery (already CANCELLED); fulfillment CANCELLED read side
-- C-27 | ORD-027, CUST-027 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1 (SKU-006), Payment VOID_FAILED, Fulfillment FAILED | PaymentVoidFailed emitted, releaseStock pending | releaseStock PAYMENT_VOID_FAILED from CONFIRMED; voidPayment redelivery on VOID_FAILED (no-op)
-- C-28 | ORD-028, CUST-028 | Order CANCELLED (PAYMENT_VOID_FAILED), StockReservation RELEASED x1 (PAYMENT_VOID_FAILED), Payment VOID_FAILED, Fulfillment FAILED, Notification ORDER_CANCELLED SENT | end orderCancelled, cause void refused | flow outcome orderCancelled/void-failed; payment VOID_FAILED read side
-- C-29 | ORD-029, CUST-029 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1 (SKU-006), Payment CAPTURED, Fulfillment SCHEDULED (paymentCapturedAt set), Notification ORDER_CONFIRMATION FAILED | end notificationFailed (NotificationDeliveryFailed) | flow outcome notificationFailed; notification FAILED read side; sendOrderConfirmation redelivery on FAILED
-- C-30 | ORD-030, CUST-030 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1 (SKU-006, past deadline), no Payment | ReservationExpired due, payment never started | expireReservation past deadline, getPaymentStatus NO_PAYMENT -> release RESERVATION_EXPIRED
-- (off-chain) products SKU-001..SKU-006 and inventory positions SKU-001..SKU-003, SKU-006: catalog/backoffice, keyed by sku
--   (SKU-006 holds the RESERVED/CONFIRMED rows of C-24, C-27, C-29, C-30, so the SKU-001/SKU-002 counters stay as before)
--
-- COVERAGE MATRIX: need -> chain/row (or why no row)
-- inventory reserveStock (new) enough stock -> SKU-001/SKU-002 positions
-- inventory reserveStock UNAVAILABLE -> SKU-003 position (available 0), C-07
-- inventory reserveStock several lines -> C-02
-- inventory confirmStockReservation from RESERVED -> C-02
-- inventory releaseStock from RESERVED (declined) -> C-15
-- inventory expireReservation past deadline, NO_PAYMENT -> C-30
-- inventory expireReservation past deadline, STARTED (no release) -> C-14
-- inventory releaseStock from RESERVED (retry exhausted) -> C-13 after retry (no stored row needed beyond C-13)
-- inventory releaseStock from CONFIRMED (voided) -> C-18
-- inventory expireReservation before deadline (no release) -> C-01
-- inventory releaseStock from CONFIRMED (PAYMENT_VOID_FAILED) -> C-27
-- inventory confirmStockReservation NOT_HELD (RELEASED) -> C-23
-- inventory redelivery confirm/release/expire -> C-03 / C-08 / C-11
-- backoffice createInventoryPosition (sku without position) -> SKU-004 product, no position
-- backoffice receiveStock / adjustStock -> SKU-001 position
-- orders startOrderCheckout (new) -> no row: input only; uses SKU-001 position
-- orders confirmOrder from CREATED -> C-02
-- orders confirmOrder rejected ORDER_CANCELLED / STOCK_NOT_HELD -> C-22 / C-23
-- orders cancelOrder from CREATED -> C-19
-- orders cancelOrder from CONFIRMED -> C-20
-- orders getOrder CREATED / CONFIRMED / CANCELLED -> C-01 / C-03 / C-08
-- payments authorizePayment (new) -> no row: OrderCreated input (saves AUTHORIZATION_REQUESTED first)
-- payments authorizePayment authorized/declined/failed -> stub-driven (provider decides)
-- payments authorizePayment redelivery -> C-01
-- payments retryPayment from FAILED below limit -> C-12
-- payments retryPayment from FAILED at limit -> C-13
-- payments reauthorizePayment from FAILED (PaymentRetried, attemptCount matches) -> C-12, C-14; stale attemptCount -> input only (no-op)
-- payments reauthorizePayment authorized/declined/failed -> stub-driven
-- payments getPaymentStatus NO_PAYMENT / STARTED -> C-30 / C-01, C-14
-- payments capturePayment from AUTHORIZED -> C-04
-- payments capturePayment captured/capture-failed -> stub-driven
-- payments capturePayment redelivery -> C-05
-- payments voidPayment from AUTHORIZED / CAPTURE_FAILED -> C-16, C-22 (OrderConfirmationRejected) / C-17
-- payments voidPayment no-op (not AUTHORIZED or CAPTURE_FAILED) -> C-01 (AUTHORIZATION_REQUESTED), C-12 (FAILED)
-- payments voidPayment voided/void-failed -> stub-driven (processor decides)
-- payments voidPayment redelivery -> C-10 (VOIDED), C-27 (VOID_FAILED)
-- payments read side VOID_FAILED -> C-28
-- fulfillment scheduleFulfillment (new) -> C-03 (OrderConfirmed, no fulfillment yet)
-- fulfillment scheduleFulfillment scheduled/failed -> stub-driven (warehouse decides)
-- fulfillment scheduleFulfillment redelivery -> C-04
-- fulfillment markReadyToShip from SCHEDULED: refused without paymentCapturedAt / allowed -> C-04 / C-24
-- fulfillment recordPaymentCaptured from SCHEDULED / redelivery -> C-05 / C-06, C-24
-- fulfillment cancelFulfillment from SCHEDULED -> C-25; redelivery C-26; no Fulfillment (no-op) C-21
-- fulfillment cancelFulfillment from READY_TO_SHIP -> no row: no flow path cancels an order after capture (voidPayment never runs on CAPTURED); a test builds it inline
-- fulfillment read side READY_TO_SHIP / FAILED / CANCELLED -> C-06 / C-16 / C-26
-- notifications sendOrderConfirmation -> C-05; redelivery C-06
-- notifications sendStockUnavailableNotification -> input only; redelivery C-07
-- notifications sendOrderCancelledNotification -> C-21; redelivery C-08
-- notifications send* failed (NotificationDeliveryFailed) -> stub-driven (e-mail provider); finished example C-29
-- notifications read side FAILED -> C-29
-- products updateProduct from DRAFT / PUBLISHED -> SKU-004 / SKU-001
-- products publishProduct from DRAFT -> SKU-004
-- products retireProduct from DRAFT / PUBLISHED -> SKU-004 / SKU-002
-- products read side RETIRED -> SKU-005
-- flow outcomes completed / stockGone / orderCancelled x6 causes / notificationFailed -> C-06 / C-07 / C-08 declined, C-09 retries, C-10 fulfillment failed, C-11 expired, C-26 capture failed, C-28 void refused / C-29
--
-- ASSUMPTIONS: id | value used | open question
-- A-01 | (retired: the 0.10.0 @transition targets give each outcome its state, P-02 accepted)
-- A-02 | stock counters: reserve moves available->reserved, confirm reserved->sold, release returns reserved (or sold) to available; reserved = sum of RESERVED rows; sold = sum of CONFIRMED rows + sales before the fixtures (SKU-003: 10) | none in the models
-- A-03 | payment retry limit = 3 attempts (attemptCount = limit -> retryPayment emits PaymentRetryExhausted) | now in the payments ZDL javadoc (N = 3, P-05)
-- A-04 | reservation window = 10 minutes: expiresAt = reservedAt + 10m (ZFL @time) | place-order-flow.zfl @time
-- A-05 | StockUnavailable creates no Order, StockReservation or Payment row (ZFL: "no order record was created") | ZDL startOrderCheckout returns Order @transition(to: CREATED)
-- A-06 | Payment.failureReason / Fulfillment.failureReason codes: card_declined, processor_timeout, capture_window_closed, fulfillment_failed, warehouse_damage | none in the models
-- A-07 | cancellationReason = StockReleased.reason (StockReleaseReason name) | orders-checkout CancelOrderInput.reason doc
-- A-08 | a released reservation keeps confirmedAt when it was CONFIRMED before (voided after fulfillment) | none
-- A-09 | a Payment can appear after the timer released the stock (late OrderCreated delivery): C-11 (AUTHORIZATION_REQUESTED), C-22/C-23 (AUTHORIZED) | P-06 B (query timer)
-- A-10 | Notification.failureReason code for a refused e-mail: smtp_rejected | none in the models
-- A-11 | Fulfillment.cancellationReason = OrderCancelled.reason (the StockReleaseReason name); void after a capture failure keeps capture_window_closed as Payment.failureReason | none in the models
-- A-12 | void refused: Payment.voidFailedAt set, failureReason keeps the void reason (fulfillment_failed) | P-08
